{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10643010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10643010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:1:1064301001:0":{"text":"초대장을 지닌 기계 전령이 규칙적인 웅웅 소리를 내며 낮게 하늘을 가로질렀다","source_cn":"一个携带邀请函的机械信使划过低空，发出规律的嗡鸣","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7AB4DE82630EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1064301002:0":{"text":"그 아래에는 황량한 산맥이 펼쳐져 있었고, 어렴풋이 오래된 룬 문자가 반짝이는 것이 보였다","source_cn":"在它下方，是一片荒芜的山地，隐约间，可见古老的符文闪烁","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93613E786120E0E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1064301003:0":{"text":"어두운 금속 갑주로 뒤덮인 커다란 손이 갑자기 그림자 속에서 뻗어 나와, 기계 전령을 단단히 움켜쥐었다...","source_cn":"一只覆盖暗色金属甲胄的大手猛然从阴影中伸出，将机械信使...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAD5645CAD37179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"기계 전령","source_cn":"机械信使","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B55A5DA7A023E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064301004:0":{"text":"드워프 공예.\n구조, 정밀.","source_cn":"矮人工艺。\\n结构，精密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05A2A6043978C7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064301005:0":{"text":"기계 전령이 지니고 있던 초대장을 떼어 낸 군나르는 그 초대장을 버리기 전, 무심코 “무기”라는 두 글자를 보고 곧바로 손을 멈췄다.","source_cn":"勒图姆摘下机械信使携带的邀请函，在丢弃之前，目光无意间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71EF5704890039E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064301006:0":{"text":"펼쳐 든 초대장의 맨 위에는 <style=\"highlight\">깊은바위 마을·무기 제작 대회·무제한</style>이라고 적혀 있었고,","source_cn":"他展开邀请函，其正上方写着：<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77629340F2AA17BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064301007:0":{"text":"무제한이라는 표현 옆에는 \n“참가자의 출신이나 고향을 불문하고, 무기 제작 기술만이 우승의 유일한 기준”이라는 주석이 붙어 있었다.","source_cn":"无限制一行注：\\n不论参赛者出身如何，来自何方，武器锻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x597591B93FB7B63E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064301008:0":{"text":"무기 제작, 대회.\n화력, 검증.","source_cn":"武器锻造，竞赛。\\n火力，验证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x617EDC07DE219EC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1064301076:0":{"text":"깊은바위 마을 광장이 사람들의 떠들썩한 소리로 가득하다...","source_cn":"深岩村广场，人声沸腾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73DBDBD5BCDAA4BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064301009:0":{"text":"여러분! 제작의 화로가 영원히 꺼지지 않는 깊은바위 마을에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 여러분의 오랜 친구, 칸로가 인사드립니다!","source_cn":"各位！欢迎来到深岩村，锻造炉火永不熄灭之地！我是你们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6D3C6D0CFF0F3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064301010:0":{"text":"드워프가 주최하는, 에스페리아 역사상 가장 개방적이고 자유로운 <style=\"highlight\">무기 제작 대회</style>! 참가 자격 심사가 곧 마감됩니다!","source_cn":"由矮人一族举办，伊索米亚有史以来最开放、最自由的<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B172E857DFBB1B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064301011:0":{"text":"여러분의 열정으로 이 전설의 서막에 불을 붙여주세요!","source_cn":"让我们用热情，点燃这传奇的序幕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FA5757644A4B98B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064301012:0":{"text":"이봐, 덩치. 그 강선은 꽤 오래된 설계인데 관리 상태가 정말 좋네.","source_cn":"嘿，大个子，你带来的膛线可是个老设计了，不过保养得真不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB577470217F7C79E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064301013:0":{"text":"그리고 너는... 화약 냄새가 나는데? 안전이 최우선이야! 알지?","source_cn":"还有这位女士，我闻到你身上的火药味了，可要注意安全啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE07F033DE0E211A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064301014:0":{"text":"올해는 숨은 고수들이 많은 것 같아. 보아하니 경쟁이 아주 치열하겠는걸? 우리 드워프들도 정신 바짝 차려야겠어!","source_cn":"今年的选手藏龙卧虎，看来，冠军之争会很激烈，我们矮人一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3991C872327866DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064301015:0":{"text":"심! 심! 해!\n조아, 구경할 만한 재밌는 게 있다며! 왜 촌스러운 녀석들만 우르르 몰려다니는 건데!","source_cn":"好——无——聊——啊！\\n祖娅， 不是说会有热闹看嘛！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x701CF59308DC518B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064301016:0":{"text":"진정 좀 해. 자, 봐. 코언이 저기 있는 베어포크 장인을 벌써 몇 번이나 노려봤거든?","source_cn":"别心急嘛，小丫头。喏，看那边，寇恩已经瞪了那个熊人工匠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45FFAD4B76D93721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064301017:0":{"text":"저 둘이 10분 안으로 말다툼을 벌일 거야. 내기 할래?","source_cn":"要不要打个赌，不出十分钟，他们就会吵起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F102794958A963","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064301018:0":{"text":"싸움? 어디, 어디?!\n싸워라! 싸워라! 팡팡, 누가 이길 것 같아?","source_cn":"打架，哪，在哪在哪？！\\n打起来！打起来！阿爆，你说谁会赢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA087F4101426CC4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064301019:0":{"text":"오오오, 무적이시고 지고하신 쿠루루 님 앞에서는 모두가 추풍낙엽처럼 쓰러져 항복할 겁니다!","source_cn":"哦哦哦，在无敌的、至尊的库露露大人面前，所有人都会望风而降！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7976493E7F568DE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064301020:0":{"text":"맞는 말이지만... 아니, 팡팡. 너 내 말 제대로 듣고 있긴 해?","source_cn":"说得倒也不错……不对，啊喂，阿爆，你到底有没有在认真听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA61A7F478A8EE05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:34::0":{"text":"초대장","source_cn":"邀请函","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83DB9B00687538B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064301021:0":{"text":"조아! 큰일 났어! 이상한 녀석이 참가하러 왔는데, 초대장에 적힌 이름이랑 달라.","source_cn":"祖娅！不好了！有个奇怪的家伙来参赛，但他和邀请函上的名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD9DE0B8EBD0302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064301022:0":{"text":"아무리 말려도 말이 안 통해. 끝까지 들어오려고 한다니까?","source_cn":"我们怎么劝他都不听，也不说话，非要往里进！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB28B4AE84B15D1BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064301023:0":{"text":"하, 어느 눈치 없는 녀석이 깊은바위 마을에서 소란을 피워? 가자!","source_cn":"嘿，是哪个不长眼的家伙敢在深岩村的地盘上闹事，走，带我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x251B64175DD54384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064301024:0":{"text":"그때, 쿠루루는 예리하게 초대장에서 풍겨 나오는 <style=\"highlight\">심연</style>의 기운을 알아차렸다. 어떤 <style=\"highlight\">악마</style>가 초대장에 손을 댄 것이 분명했다.","source_cn":"这时，库露露敏锐察觉到邀请函上散发着来自<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A42F0BCC46AB9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064301025:0":{"text":"자자자잠깐! 내가 갈게. 나 보내줘! 저런 잔챙이 상대하는데, 조아 네가 직접 나서는 건 안 되지!","source_cn":"等等等等！我去，让我去！这种小角色，哪用得着祖娅你出手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x328543D558617900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064301026:0":{"text":"쯧쯧, 해가 서쪽에서 뜨겠네. 네가 언제부터 그렇게 내 생각을 다 했대?","source_cn":"啧啧，太阳打西边出来了，你什么时候这么热心肠了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2333077C6D694FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064301027:0":{"text":"항상! 그리고 엄청 심심하다고. 할 일을 찾아야겠어. 그치, 팡팡?","source_cn":"我一直都很热心好不好！而且多无聊，找点事做嘛。阿爆，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x850C65090896B509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064301028:0":{"text":"맞습니다요, 쿠루루 님께서는 남을 돕는 걸 즐기시죠. 구닥다리 악마들과는 다르게요.","source_cn":"没错，库露露大人向来以助人为乐，和那些落后的老派恶魔可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD987434056C30A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064301029:0":{"text":"그래, 가려면 가. 난 여기 남아서 저 두 녀석이 진짜로 싸우지 않게 현장을 지켜봐야 하니까.","source_cn":"行吧，你去就你去。正好我还得留在这里监场，免得那两个家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269963DF76D340D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064301030:0":{"text":"하지만 정말로 난동을 피우려 온 놈이라면 혼자 무리하지 말고 나한테 연락해. 바로 갈 테니까.","source_cn":"不过，要是对方真是个来闹事的硬茬子，别逞强，喊一声我就过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C63A892D5ACD02C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064301031:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 나 협상 잘 해.\n가자, 팡팡! 안내해!","source_cn":"放心啦，交涉可是我的强项。\\n走，阿爆，带路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08F5D65D99445F1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064301032:0":{"text":"네, 쿠루루 님! 이쪽입니다!","source_cn":"是！库露露大人这边请！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A4C81758363E862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064301033:0":{"text":"나사형 폐쇄기, 복합식 드럼 탄창, 전면 금속 포신...\n무기, 완비.","source_cn":"螺式炮闩、聚合弹鼓、全金属膛管……\\n军械，全备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD29A619603601641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064301034:0":{"text":"쿠루루가 살금살금 군나르에게 다가가는 순간...","source_cn":"库露露轻手轻脚地接近勒图姆，突然……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1B6D9F1CDD617AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064301035:0":{"text":"포탄 하나가 아무런 예고도 없이 그녀에게 날아갔다!","source_cn":"一枚炮弹毫无预兆地向她袭来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7053CC42C645D6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064301036:0":{"text":"쿠루루 곁에 있던 팡팡이 빠르게 부풀어 오르더니 커다란 입을 벌려 포탄을 한입에 삼켜 버렸다.","source_cn":"库露露身边的阿爆急速膨胀，张开大嘴，一口将炮弹吞下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4349FD0CD1369579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064301037:0":{"text":"꾸... 꿀....꺽...","source_cn":"咕……咕噜噜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2FE71811F33044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064301038:0":{"text":"아아악, 팡팡! 괜찮아?!\n너, 너어어! 어디서 온 쇠대가리야? 건드리지도 않았는데 시비냐?!","source_cn":"啊啊啊，阿爆你没事吧？！\\n你你你，哪来的铁块头，我又...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17DF55496C64869B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064301039:0":{"text":"끄윽... 끄으... 쿠, 쿠루루 님... 저... 소화 좀...","source_cn":"呃……咕……主人，我、我得消化一下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4A8E538D4107B16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064301040:0":{"text":"땅이 미세하게 흔들릴 정도로 묵직하게 발걸음을 옮긴 군나르가 팡팡을 자세히 살펴보았다.","source_cn":"勒图姆向前走了两步，沉重的脚步让地面微微震动，他仔细打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4C4A56F49EE328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064301041:0":{"text":"멍청한 척 입 다물고 있으면 넘어갈 줄 아냐, 이 쇠대가리야!","source_cn":"别以为装傻不说话就没事了，铁块头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0451B9FE5644AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064301042:0":{"text":"너, 쿠루스터?","source_cn":"你是，库露丝塔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4A7344D04BA3196","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064301043:1":{"text":"닥쳐! 누가 그딴 녀석이래? 지금 나는 새롭게 태어난 위대한 쿠루루 님이시라고!","source_cn":"住口！我早就不是过去那家伙了！现在的是新生的、伟大的库...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x011A0C0FCA9C11DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064301044:1":{"text":"팡팡, 소화 다 됐으면 이 건방진 녀석한테 본때를 보여 줘!","source_cn":"阿爆，调整好了就上，给这个目中无人的家伙一点颜色瞧瞧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x715A5FC46055D117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064301045:1":{"text":"끄윽... 쿠루루 님, 어, 언제든 출격할 준비가 되어 있습니다요.","source_cn":"嗝——主人，我、我……随时准备出击。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68ECE2E41EDEAA6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064301046:1":{"text":"우상. 완벽!\n강력한 폭탄, 모든 것 평정!","source_cn":"偶像，完美！\\n强劲炸弹，荡平一切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C8A7ECFF8592827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064301047:1":{"text":"어, 잠깐. 팡팡, 잠깐만...\n야, 쇠대가리. 너 방금 우상이니 완벽하다니, 그거 누구한테 한 말이야?","source_cn":"欸，等等，阿爆你先别动……\\n铁块头，你刚刚说偶像、完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x758FAF437D4D5ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064301048:0":{"text":"너다, 쿠루스터.","source_cn":"你，库露丝塔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40039BA5185FBA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064301049:1":{"text":"건방지다! 감히 쿠루루 님의 존함을 함부로 부르다니...","source_cn":"大胆，竟敢直呼库露露大人的名讳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D19D7EC81C17E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064301050:1":{"text":"됐어, 팡팡. 이 쇠대가리, 그냥 좀 멍청한가 봐.","source_cn":"算了算了，阿爆，这铁块头的脑子好像不太聪明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A616B700EFF6A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064301051:1":{"text":"그래도 화력에 대해 좀 아는 녀석 같으니까 이번만 봐줄게. 앞으로는 쿠루루 님이라고 불러!","source_cn":"不过，看你也是个懂火力的家伙嘛，就不跟你计较了。以后得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA49C80E713F920D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064301052:1":{"text":"그래서 우상을 찾으러 온 거 말고, 남의 초대장 훔쳐다 사기 치면서까지 여기까지 온 진짜 이유가 뭐야?","source_cn":"说吧，除了见偶像以外，到这儿来干嘛，还拿着别人的邀请函...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63219602327CBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064301053:1":{"text":"대회, 무제한.\n최상급 화력, 검증.","source_cn":"竞赛，无限制。\\n顶级火力，验证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057D00468AC2971D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064301054:1":{"text":"푸흡... 너 설마 저기 드워프나 인간들이랑 무기를 갖고 겨루기라도 하려고? 하하하! 그럭저럭 말은 되네.","source_cn":"噗……你想跟那些矮人、人类比做武器？哈哈哈！勉强说得过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x955ECD0D1A5C8BD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064301055:1":{"text":"하지만 네가 방금 나한테 쏜 그 한 방 때문에 기분이 아주 나빠. 매우, 아주, 엄청 나빠.","source_cn":"不过，你刚才轰我那一炮，让我很不爽。非常、非常不爽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77065F81CDC992A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064301056:1":{"text":"우리 쪽 규칙대로라면, 내 기분이 풀릴 만한 쏠쏠한 걸 챙겨줘야 용서해 줄 수 있거든.","source_cn":"按照我们那儿的规矩，你得赔点好处，让我心情好受些，才能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04A621C645F181A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064301057:1":{"text":"군나르는 그 “규칙”이라는 것이 무엇인지 이해하지 못한 듯, 쿠루루를 바라보았다.","source_cn":"勒图姆沉默地看着库露露，似乎不明白她所说的规矩是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5184512201BF4B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064301058:1":{"text":"너 진짜 우리 쪽 출신 맞아? 왜 싸움 말고는 아는 게 하나도 없지? 나